{518}{Uh...  Perhaps a different location...}{}{5}{}{27}{}
{519}{Can you tell me where Blackroot is located?}{}{5}{}{535}{}
{520}{Bah!  Dern steam rails made sure me ship was of no use to Ashbury!  That damnable contraption'll be the death of me yet!  Mark me words!}{Bah!  Dern steam rails made sure me ship was of no use to Ashbury!  That damnable contraption'll be the death of me yet!  Mark me words!}{}{}{}{}
{521}{Then perhaps I should sail to a different location...}{}{5}{}{27}{}
{522}{Can you tell me where Ashbury is located?}{}{5}{}{524}{}
{523}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{524}{It be right thar.  [He points to a spot on your map.]}{It be right thar.  [He points to a spot on your map.]}{}{}{}{mm 8}
{525}{Can I book passage to a different location?}{}{5}{}{27}{}
{526}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{527}{Thanatos!  Ye'll not find anyone fool enough to take ye to that destination 'round here!  Try Blackroot.  That place is full of desperate fools!}{Thanatos!  Ye'll not find anyone fool enough to take ye to that destination 'round here!  Try Blackroot.  That place is full of desperate fools!}{}{}{}{}
{529}{Can I book passage to a different location then?}{}{5}{}{27}{}
{530}{Uh...  Me go on boat?}{}{-4}{}{608}{}
