{535}{Thar it be.  [He points to a location on your map.]}{Thar it be.  [He points to a location on your map.]}{}{}{}{mm 3}
{536}{Could I get passage somewhere else?}{}{5}{}{27}{}
{537}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{538}{Thanatos?  Are ye daft?  This boat will never go there!}{Thanatos?  Are ye daft?  This boat will never go there!}{}{}{}{}
