{541}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{542}{Isle of Despair?  If you got any wits about ye, ye'll avoid landing on that rock!}{Isle of Despair?  If you got any wits about ye, ye'll avoid landing on that rock!}{}{}{}{}
{543}{Why?  What sort of place is it?}{}{5}{}{545}{}
